    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "12.0 Sample User Stories ",
            "block_bbox": [
                81,
                85,
                591,
                133
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. As a lawyer want to be able to check the relevant documents by asking the chatbot to.ensure that all the information I\"m receiving is accurate ",
            "block_bbox": [
                119,
                159,
                1088,
                223
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Answers should include references to the relevant documents ",
            "block_bbox": [
                197,
                230,
                914,
                257
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Links should be provided so that the user may view the documents ",
            "block_bbox": [
                198,
                262,
                966,
                290
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. As a SUPER fund member, I want to be able to check my SUPER's balance history ",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                326,
                1063,
                391
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Chatbot should provide clear numbers based on official documents ",
            "block_bbox": [
                197,
                395,
                964,
                420
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. I as a SUPER fund member, I want the chatbot to be able to give me a summary of my SUPER's condition so that I can have an idea of how its doing at a glance a. Chatbot should provide clear numbers based on official documents ",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                455,
                1058,
                551
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. As a chatbot user, I want to be provided with a list of questions for what I can ask the chatbot so that I know what questions are supported.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                587,
                1072,
                647
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Upon interaction with the chatbot, it should provide a list of questions for the user to ask \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                196,
                656,
                1058,
                710
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b.  Each question should return accurate answers ",
            "block_bbox": [
                197,
                721,
                744,
                744
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. As a SUPER fund member, I want to be informed of any issues or updates so that I am kept up to date on any problems..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                785,
                1057,
                843
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": " a. The chatbot should be able to inform the user of any significant changes to the SUPER fund.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                196,
                852,
                1051,
                905
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6.  As an Advisor, I want to ask questions about TTR (Transition to Retirement)processes so that I can provide accurate advice grounded in official fund rules.",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                948,
                1011,
                1008
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Answers must include direct citations and links to the source PDFs in the S3bucket.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                192,
                1015,
                1069,
                1069
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 14
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7.  As a Back-office Admin, I want to verify a specific fund's trust deed update date to ensure I am using the latest regulation..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                1168,
                1053,
                1226
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 15
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The chatbot must prioritize and identify documents based on extracted Effective Date metadata.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                191,
                1233,
                1014,
                1289
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": 16
        }
    ],
